WEBVTT

00:00:02.550 --> 00:00:04.120
Shugo, shugo!

00:00:04.120 --> 00:00:06.820
Start it off with a Doki! It's Shugo Chara time!

00:00:06.820 --> 00:00:10.540
This time, we'll meet a teen glamor 
model who's the talk of the town!

00:00:10.540 --> 00:00:12.930
Ooh, this is gonna be swell, I know it!

00:00:12.930 --> 00:00:15.130
But our Amu-chan will give 
her a run for her money! {as in, being popular contest}

00:00:15.130 --> 00:00:19.350
Oh? It looks like a new Guardian Character will appear.

00:00:19.350 --> 00:00:21.660
I've got an extra-super, 
great feeling about today!

00:00:21.660 --> 00:00:22.910
Doki!

00:00:22.910 --> 00:00:24.960
And now, I'll sing!

00:00:48.510 --> 00:00:51.360
I'm gonna tell you a secret.

00:00:51.360 --> 00:00:54.270
Don't tell <i>anyone</i>, okay?

00:00:54.270 --> 00:00:57.160
Even though I'm not girly at all,

00:00:57.160 --> 00:00:59.930
two certain boys said they like me!

00:00:59.930 --> 00:01:02.870
Jump up a bit into the sky.

00:01:02.870 --> 00:01:05.750
My dearest friends are always there.

00:01:05.750 --> 00:01:08.580
Even if you suddenly Character Change,

00:01:08.580 --> 00:01:11.490
I'll be there to stop you with my great big heart.

00:01:11.490 --> 00:01:14.360
Pinky swear!

00:01:14.360 --> 00:01:16.760
Cross my heart!

00:01:17.240 --> 00:01:19.970
Lucky, happy, leave it to me!

00:01:19.970 --> 00:01:23.020
That'd be universal peace, but...

00:01:23.020 --> 00:01:25.770
I'll end up protectin' everyone's hearts.

00:01:25.770 --> 00:01:28.540
Let's all smile together!

00:01:28.540 --> 00:01:31.400
Lucky, happy, leave it to me!

00:01:31.400 --> 00:01:34.210
That's world peace! Yeah, that!

00:01:34.510 --> 00:01:37.440
Everyone has dreams, so I'm gonna protect 'em!

00:01:37.440 --> 00:01:40.260
Make a victory sign together!

00:01:56.740 --> 00:01:59.100
I've got big news! Big news!

00:01:59.100 --> 00:02:00.140
Ta-da!

00:02:01.460 --> 00:02:02.990
Oh, it's <i>Pretty!</i>

00:02:02.990 --> 00:02:03.930
What about it?

00:02:03.930 --> 00:02:06.000
It's a magazine about the latest in teen fashion!

00:02:06.000 --> 00:02:09.150
Amu-chan reads it, of course.

00:02:10.100 --> 00:02:11.850
Check out this page.

00:02:11.850 --> 00:02:14.520
"Teens Stylin' with Yua?"

00:02:14.520 --> 00:02:17.110
Hasn't she been incredibly popular lately?

00:02:17.110 --> 00:02:20.740
Yeah! She's Sakurai Yua, 
a magazine glamor model.

00:02:22.330 --> 00:02:24.600
So what's the big news?

00:02:24.600 --> 00:02:30.460
Well you see, their next article 
is going to feature us Guardians!

00:02:32.860 --> 00:02:34.680
Is that true, Tadase-kun?

00:02:34.680 --> 00:02:36.850
Nobody told me...

00:02:36.850 --> 00:02:38.350
Could Yaya have...

00:02:38.350 --> 00:02:41.900
Correct-a-mundo! I applied for us!

00:02:41.900 --> 00:02:43.370
Not again...

00:02:43.370 --> 00:02:46.640
And it's all so I can 
see Yua in the flesh!

00:02:46.640 --> 00:02:47.750
That explains it...

00:02:47.750 --> 00:02:50.890
Although, I kind of want to meet her, too.

00:02:51.400 --> 00:02:54.900
But we can't just up and do a photo shoot...

00:02:54.900 --> 00:02:56.580
When is it?

00:02:56.580 --> 00:02:58.740
Today, hooray!

00:03:04.850 --> 00:03:09.620
Episode 85
Wassup! Here Comes the Gal Everyone's Talking About!!

00:03:16.550 --> 00:03:18.510
Sure are a lot of 
people, don't you think?

00:03:18.810 --> 00:03:21.700
Everyone's gathered to see Yua.

00:03:21.700 --> 00:03:22.730
What a bunch of sheep.

00:03:22.730 --> 00:03:25.240
I wonder when she'll get here?

00:03:26.340 --> 00:03:27.220
There she is!

00:03:27.520 --> 00:03:29.970
The glamor model appears at last!

00:03:29.970 --> 00:03:32.480
Yua-tan is inside that car!

00:03:32.480 --> 00:03:34.980
I'm so excited!

00:03:49.250 --> 00:03:51.390
Wassup!

00:03:51.870 --> 00:03:53.870
Wassup!

00:03:54.170 --> 00:03:56.060
What presence!

00:03:56.060 --> 00:03:58.790
You know, she's a year younger than us.

00:03:58.790 --> 00:04:00.050
Oh, really?

00:04:00.050 --> 00:04:01.350
Wassup!

00:04:01.350 --> 00:04:04.170
I'm Sakurai Yua! Thanks for having me today!

00:04:04.170 --> 00:04:05.730
Wassup!

00:04:05.730 --> 00:04:07.400
Uh, welcome.

00:04:07.930 --> 00:04:11.600
No, Tadase! It's "wassup, wassup!"

00:04:11.900 --> 00:04:13.730
Wassup!

00:04:19.300 --> 00:04:20.780
Wassup!

00:04:24.800 --> 00:04:26.620
I'm gonna take the picture now!

00:04:26.920 --> 00:04:29.620
Ready and... Wassup!

00:04:33.040 --> 00:04:34.320
You look like a girl.

00:04:34.320 --> 00:04:35.620
I get that a lot.

00:04:38.590 --> 00:04:40.880
So adorable!

00:04:44.510 --> 00:04:47.850
Tadase-sama! King!

00:04:47.850 --> 00:04:50.770
Oh? So you're the Prince of this school?

00:04:50.770 --> 00:04:51.810
Prince?

00:04:51.810 --> 00:04:54.770
I am no mere Pri-

00:04:58.020 --> 00:05:01.190
It's Amu-chan's turn next.

00:05:02.080 --> 00:05:03.690
Thanks for being here...

00:05:06.200 --> 00:05:08.410
Amu-chan!

00:05:08.610 --> 00:05:10.450
Good luck!

00:05:11.390 --> 00:05:12.660
Amu?

00:05:12.660 --> 00:05:14.160
Look over here, please!

00:05:19.510 --> 00:05:20.960
Yamabuki-san?

00:05:21.260 --> 00:05:26.340
Just leave the modeling to me, Yamabuki Saya!

00:05:26.640 --> 00:05:30.390
All right, Mr. Cameraman, 
let's make that shutter flutter!

00:05:31.870 --> 00:05:34.130
Okay, that's a wrap.

00:05:34.130 --> 00:05:35.660
U-Um...

00:05:37.820 --> 00:05:39.800
Sure looks like everyone's having fun.

00:05:39.800 --> 00:05:40.430
Yeah!

00:05:40.430 --> 00:05:43.880
I would love to give modeling a try!

00:05:43.880 --> 00:05:47.230
And now, I'll sing "Unattainable Dream!"

00:05:48.310 --> 00:05:49.750
What's the matter?

00:05:49.750 --> 00:05:52.210
I thought I heard a voice.

00:05:57.180 --> 00:05:59.340
Ready and...

00:05:59.340 --> 00:06:01.370
Wassup!

00:06:06.850 --> 00:06:09.350
Yua-tan, may I have your autograph?

00:06:09.350 --> 00:06:10.430
Okay!

00:06:10.430 --> 00:06:11.520
Thanks!

00:06:11.520 --> 00:06:12.260
Me, too!

00:06:14.190 --> 00:06:17.590
I guess this is normal for a famous model.

00:06:17.590 --> 00:06:18.750
Hey, Amu...

00:06:19.510 --> 00:06:23.880
Thank you very much! I, Suzuki Seichiro, 
will treasure it for the rest of my life!

00:06:23.880 --> 00:06:26.300
Didn't that boy used to be your fan?

00:06:27.090 --> 00:06:29.460
Ah, Hinamori-senpai!

00:06:29.460 --> 00:06:32.280
Hinamori? Hinamori Amu?

00:06:32.280 --> 00:06:34.660
Please don't misunderstand, Hinamori-senpai!

00:06:34.660 --> 00:06:38.330
I, Suzuki Seichiro, will always 
be in your corner!

00:06:38.330 --> 00:06:40.060
Um, it's no big deal...

00:06:38.330 --> 00:06:42.170
I only have eyes for you!

00:06:40.060 --> 00:06:41.440
Traitor.

00:06:42.170 --> 00:06:44.250
Traitor? Don't say that...

00:06:47.830 --> 00:06:50.090
Hinamori Amu-san?

00:06:51.970 --> 00:06:54.510
It's been too long, Hinamori-senpai!

00:06:58.780 --> 00:07:01.880
So you went to the same 
kindergarten as Yua-tan, Amu-chi?

00:07:01.880 --> 00:07:06.930
I was in the Violet Class. Senpai was one year 
older and in the Whale Class.

00:07:06.930 --> 00:07:09.150
Amu-chan, don't you remember her?

00:07:14.790 --> 00:07:17.540
We did a folk dance together at the sports festival?

00:07:17.540 --> 00:07:18.520
No..

00:07:18.520 --> 00:07:20.240
We went on a hike?

00:07:20.240 --> 00:07:21.270
Nope.

00:07:21.270 --> 00:07:22.600
We met at naptime?

00:07:22.600 --> 00:07:23.980
Wrong!

00:07:28.290 --> 00:07:29.780
Not a people person, were you?

00:07:30.500 --> 00:07:32.990
Don't worry about it. It was back 
in kindergarten, after all.

00:07:32.990 --> 00:07:37.770
Yeah. Even I didn't realize 
it at first, Senpai.

00:07:37.770 --> 00:07:42.420
And the Yua you knew back then 
was totally normal and boring.

00:07:42.420 --> 00:07:47.480
Anyway, we went to the same kindergarten, 
sure, but we never played together.

00:07:47.950 --> 00:07:50.600
We actually only spoke once.

00:07:50.600 --> 00:07:56.190
I switched to another school after that, 
so that was the only time we met.

00:07:57.070 --> 00:07:58.870
So that's what happened!

00:07:58.870 --> 00:08:01.050
It's not surprising you don't remember.

00:08:01.050 --> 00:08:02.460
But...

00:08:03.590 --> 00:08:08.580
But the words you spoke to me that day... 
They're still totally inside my heart!

00:08:09.000 --> 00:08:12.280
What'd I say? Nothing weird, I hope.

00:08:13.560 --> 00:08:17.430
Meeting you again might be fate!

00:08:20.210 --> 00:08:23.980
And now, I'll sing "Fate Foretold!"

00:08:24.280 --> 00:08:25.620
A Guardian Character?

00:08:25.620 --> 00:08:27.340
We saw her before!

00:08:27.340 --> 00:08:32.120
How do you do? I'm Cecil, 
Yua-chan's Guardian Character!

00:08:32.120 --> 00:08:33.690
Yua's Guardian Character?

00:08:33.690 --> 00:08:36.950
Hey, why are you always 
following me around?

00:08:37.220 --> 00:08:38.830
You are <i>so</i> annoying.

00:08:41.940 --> 00:08:43.800
Annoying?

00:08:43.800 --> 00:08:47.510
I don't think she knows 
much about Guardian Characters.

00:08:48.690 --> 00:08:50.530
What I want to be?

00:08:50.530 --> 00:08:52.710
Right, a Guardian Character.

00:08:52.710 --> 00:08:57.430
In other words, Cecil-chan is an embodiment of who you might like to be.

00:09:01.600 --> 00:09:04.770
That shrimp? As if!

00:09:04.770 --> 00:09:06.910
You're mega hilarious!

00:09:06.910 --> 00:09:09.910
And now, I'll sing "My Shattered Pride!"

00:09:09.910 --> 00:09:10.840
Stop it.

00:09:10.840 --> 00:09:12.940
And now, I'll sing "I'll Do What I Want!"

00:09:13.220 --> 00:09:14.820
Knock it off, all right?

00:09:15.060 --> 00:09:16.780
I love to sing!

00:09:16.780 --> 00:09:19.690
Well, <i>I</i> hate it!

00:09:20.540 --> 00:09:22.160
Um...

00:09:22.460 --> 00:09:23.110
Love it!

00:09:23.110 --> 00:09:24.250
Hate it!

00:09:24.250 --> 00:09:24.940
Love it!

00:09:24.940 --> 00:09:25.940
Hate it!

00:09:25.940 --> 00:09:28.110
Stop it, you two.

00:09:28.110 --> 00:09:30.560
Someone who doesn't get along with their Guardian Character...

00:09:30.560 --> 00:09:32.870
Well, there's a new one.

00:09:32.870 --> 00:09:34.610
Yua-chan.

00:09:34.610 --> 00:09:37.200
It's almost time for your next job!

00:09:37.200 --> 00:09:38.300
Coming!

00:09:39.230 --> 00:09:40.470
Aw, you're leaving already?

00:09:40.830 --> 00:09:44.320
Yeah, I have to get to my next shoot.

00:09:44.320 --> 00:09:49.230
I know! Please come hang out 
with me at the studio next time!

00:09:49.230 --> 00:09:52.000
Check out the studio? I'm so there!

00:09:52.000 --> 00:09:54.210
I guess I'll go if Amu's going...

00:09:54.210 --> 00:09:55.690
I never said I'd go.

00:09:55.990 --> 00:09:58.240
Okay then, this Sunday it is!

00:09:58.240 --> 00:09:59.910
Wassup!

00:10:02.000 --> 00:10:06.660
It kinda feels like I was 
dragged around all day by Yua.

00:10:06.660 --> 00:10:07.620
That's for sure.

00:10:07.620 --> 00:10:11.880
And now, I'll sing "Please Notice Me."

00:10:12.720 --> 00:10:14.760
Why are you there?

00:10:16.070 --> 00:10:17.800
Hey, where's Yua?

00:10:17.800 --> 00:10:19.490
She's working.

00:10:19.490 --> 00:10:21.040
And you're not with her?

00:10:21.040 --> 00:10:23.040
Even though you're her Guardian Character?

00:10:23.040 --> 00:10:25.620
Yua-chan's easily annoyed...

00:10:25.620 --> 00:10:28.270
I feel rather sorry for you.

00:10:28.270 --> 00:10:32.480
Let's have a party to 
celebrate our meeting, Cecil-chan!

00:10:32.480 --> 00:10:34.020
A party?

00:10:34.020 --> 00:10:35.430
That sounds wonderful!

00:10:35.430 --> 00:10:37.360
Nice idea!

00:10:37.770 --> 00:10:39.720
What for, exactly?

00:10:41.220 --> 00:10:44.320
And now, I'll sing "Sparkle, Sparkle!"

00:10:44.320 --> 00:10:45.660
Yay!

00:10:45.960 --> 00:10:48.570
Mr. Sun, sparkle, sparkle!

00:10:48.570 --> 00:10:50.390
Sparkle, sparkle!

00:10:50.390 --> 00:10:53.000
The sunny beach, sparkle, sparkle!

00:10:53.000 --> 00:10:55.220
Sparkle, sparkle!

00:10:55.220 --> 00:10:56.750
Pipe down-nya!

00:10:56.750 --> 00:10:58.850
Give me a break...

00:10:58.850 --> 00:11:01.190
I'm going to look for Ikuto-nya!

00:11:03.380 --> 00:11:06.500
Thank you, you've been 
a wonderful audience!

00:11:07.630 --> 00:11:09.480
It's finally over...

00:11:09.780 --> 00:11:12.080
Cecil-chan, your voice is beautiful!

00:11:12.080 --> 00:11:15.180
You really enjoy singing, don't you?

00:11:15.180 --> 00:11:19.570
It's because I was born 
from Yua-chan, who loves to sing.

00:11:20.880 --> 00:11:25.360
Then why did she say she hated it before?

00:11:25.360 --> 00:11:31.410
Yua-chan's abandoned her dream 
of becoming a singer...

00:11:31.410 --> 00:11:32.210
A singer?

00:11:33.470 --> 00:11:39.210
I've said too much! S-So now, 
I'll sing "Until We Meet Again!"

00:11:40.160 --> 00:11:41.350
She left...

00:11:41.350 --> 00:11:45.390
Oh, so that was her way 
of saying goodbye. I get it!

00:11:45.390 --> 00:11:47.060
Try to catch up...

00:11:58.200 --> 00:12:00.730
What was I singing?

00:12:25.760 --> 00:12:27.500
Wow.

00:12:27.500 --> 00:12:30.210
Yua-chan seems like a totally different person.

00:12:30.210 --> 00:12:32.590
Yeah, this is like a whole new world.

00:12:32.590 --> 00:12:33.690
She's pretty!

00:12:34.020 --> 00:12:35.680
Makeup!

00:12:35.680 --> 00:12:36.460
Yaya?

00:12:36.460 --> 00:12:38.140
Hey, what do you think you're doing?

00:12:38.140 --> 00:12:40.210
Let the Yaya work her magic!

00:12:40.210 --> 00:12:42.080
But that's just...

00:12:40.770 --> 00:12:45.360
What's the problem? 
Just leave Yua-tan to me!

00:12:45.360 --> 00:12:47.910
Cool, do it, do it!

00:12:48.220 --> 00:12:49.960
Take five!

00:12:52.750 --> 00:12:54.870
Even during breaks?

00:12:55.110 --> 00:13:01.330
A model's skin is her life, and legs swell up 
after standing all day.

00:13:01.330 --> 00:13:03.460
"A model's skin is her life."

00:13:03.460 --> 00:13:06.140
Being a model sure is tough.

00:13:06.140 --> 00:13:07.890
Nah, it's not.

00:13:07.890 --> 00:13:10.350
Hey, why don't you give it a try?

00:13:23.990 --> 00:13:26.420
Is that really me?

00:13:26.420 --> 00:13:29.910
You're gorgeous! I totally knew 
you'd pull it off!

00:13:29.910 --> 00:13:30.540
Really?

00:13:30.540 --> 00:13:31.490
Yeah!

00:13:39.670 --> 00:13:41.620
Lucky...

00:13:41.620 --> 00:13:44.510
I wanna model, too!

00:13:57.890 --> 00:14:00.520
You really did well, Amu-chan!

00:14:00.520 --> 00:14:01.970
You think?

00:14:01.970 --> 00:14:05.360
Man, I'm so jealous! I wish it was me!

00:14:17.310 --> 00:14:20.110
So you really <i>do</i> love to sing.

00:14:23.620 --> 00:14:26.670
I can't believe this. 
What am I singing?

00:14:26.670 --> 00:14:29.800
Your deam is to be a singer, isn't it?

00:14:30.270 --> 00:14:32.220
Oh, is that true?

00:14:33.480 --> 00:14:35.850
What did you tell her?

00:14:42.690 --> 00:14:44.650
I can't believe this.

00:14:47.200 --> 00:14:48.990
What's the big deal?

00:14:52.960 --> 00:14:55.330
Being a singer sounds 
pretty cool to me.

00:14:55.700 --> 00:14:59.250
Senpai? You think so?

00:14:59.520 --> 00:15:00.720
Yeah!

00:15:06.620 --> 00:15:07.800
Yua-chan.

00:15:08.550 --> 00:15:10.830
About this year's "Girls' Festival"...

00:15:10.830 --> 00:15:14.590
GirlFest? You mean that 
famous fashion show?!

00:15:14.590 --> 00:15:16.470
You're gonna be in it?!

00:15:16.470 --> 00:15:17.180
Amu.

00:15:17.470 --> 00:15:21.820
They invited you to sing there, actually.

00:15:21.820 --> 00:15:22.480
Sing?

00:15:24.150 --> 00:15:26.220
You're gonna sing, Yua-tan?!

00:15:26.220 --> 00:15:28.340
I am <i>so totally there!</i>

00:15:28.340 --> 00:15:30.320
If Amu's going, then I 
guess I will, too.

00:15:30.620 --> 00:15:32.190
Good for you!

00:15:32.910 --> 00:15:36.160
Would you come?

00:15:36.160 --> 00:15:37.470
Of course!

00:15:40.680 --> 00:15:41.500
All right.

00:15:43.150 --> 00:15:45.170
Then, I guess I'm gonna sing!

00:15:45.170 --> 00:15:46.260
You sure?

00:15:46.260 --> 00:15:47.940
Absolutely!

00:15:47.940 --> 00:15:49.350
I can do it!

00:15:49.350 --> 00:15:50.870
Yeah!

00:15:56.340 --> 00:15:58.090
Yua-chan...

00:16:01.000 --> 00:16:02.810
Okay, I'll play the song now.

00:16:10.320 --> 00:16:14.030
If Senpai's gonna be there, 
I've gotta make this good.

00:16:20.560 --> 00:16:21.700
What's the matter?

00:16:21.700 --> 00:16:23.750
I'm sorry. Start over, please.

00:16:30.540 --> 00:16:33.000
I'm sorry. Once more, please.

00:16:33.000 --> 00:16:35.870
And it's back again...

00:16:35.870 --> 00:16:38.290
I knew this wouldn't work.

00:16:54.820 --> 00:16:57.570
Wow, everyone's totally dressed up for this!

00:16:57.570 --> 00:16:59.660
Well, it is a fashion show, after all.

00:17:00.470 --> 00:17:03.120
Didn't you go all out yourself, Amu?

00:17:03.420 --> 00:17:05.370
You and Yaya can't talk.

00:17:06.580 --> 00:17:11.220
She woke up early today to choose her outfit.

00:17:11.220 --> 00:17:12.440
So did Rima!

00:17:12.440 --> 00:17:14.000
So did Yaya-tan-dechu.

00:17:14.930 --> 00:17:17.330
Must be tough to be a girl.

00:17:17.330 --> 00:17:18.680
Indeed.

00:17:18.680 --> 00:17:21.940
Boy, Nagi sure is late...

00:17:22.350 --> 00:17:23.570
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:17:25.200 --> 00:17:28.500
I couldn't decide what to wear, 
so I ended up running behind.

00:17:28.500 --> 00:17:31.030
And it looks like we have a winner...

00:17:35.030 --> 00:17:36.530
Huh?

00:17:36.530 --> 00:17:40.020
Yua's dressing room should 
be around here somewhere.

00:17:40.020 --> 00:17:41.160
Amu?

00:17:42.610 --> 00:17:43.910
Utau!

00:17:43.910 --> 00:17:45.290
Yo!

00:17:45.290 --> 00:17:47.330
Why are you here?

00:17:49.430 --> 00:17:51.800
I didn't know you were performing, too!

00:17:51.800 --> 00:17:55.100
Did you think I couldn't 
do fashion shows?

00:17:55.100 --> 00:17:57.330
Why're you so touchy?

00:17:57.330 --> 00:18:00.740
Utau's actually happy to see you!

00:18:01.390 --> 00:18:03.220
Il, shut up!

00:18:03.220 --> 00:18:05.250
So are you going to model?

00:18:05.250 --> 00:18:09.150
I'm just a guest performer. You don't have to 
stay and listen or anything.

00:18:09.450 --> 00:18:14.320
Utau-chan's super pumped 'cause it's been a 
while since she's sung in front of a big crowd!

00:18:14.320 --> 00:18:16.050
El, you shut up, too!

00:18:17.980 --> 00:18:19.500
Wassup!

00:18:19.500 --> 00:18:21.020
Wassup!

00:18:21.620 --> 00:18:23.460
You're all here!

00:18:23.460 --> 00:18:25.830
Hey, you can't be here! This is a restricted ar-

00:18:26.070 --> 00:18:28.250
Just chill out, man!

00:18:28.250 --> 00:18:30.250
Be cool!

00:18:29.210 --> 00:18:31.130
Yua, good luck today.

00:18:31.130 --> 00:18:33.640
Hey, what kind of song 
will you be singing?

00:18:33.640 --> 00:18:34.960
Actually...

00:18:40.820 --> 00:18:43.590
I'm only lip-syncing.

00:18:43.590 --> 00:18:45.070
Lip-syncing?

00:18:47.730 --> 00:18:49.870
What? But why?

00:18:49.870 --> 00:18:50.980
We have no choice.

00:18:51.850 --> 00:18:53.610
You sure this is what you want?

00:18:57.700 --> 00:19:00.380
It's almost show time. 
You guys need to leave.

00:19:00.380 --> 00:19:02.720
Huh? But, but...

00:19:05.000 --> 00:19:07.340
So Yua-tan's going to lip-sync...

00:19:07.340 --> 00:19:10.360
If she agreed to it, 
I don't see the problem.

00:19:10.360 --> 00:19:13.500
But I wanted to hear Yua-tan's voice.

00:19:13.800 --> 00:19:19.340
It's my job to put feelings into my songs, 
so I'd never think of lip-syncing.

00:19:21.210 --> 00:19:25.040
But singing's also something you do for the audience.

00:19:25.040 --> 00:19:31.060
She's a model, so even if she's lip-syncing, 
as long as those listening are enjoying themselves...

00:19:32.180 --> 00:19:34.360
I think it's completely fine.

00:19:35.710 --> 00:19:40.280
But I thought Yua wanted to really sing.

00:20:01.850 --> 00:20:06.350
We've got a problem! The control room screwed up 
and deleted Yua-chan's vocals!

00:20:06.650 --> 00:20:08.970
What? But it's almost her cue!

00:20:09.270 --> 00:20:11.120
What should we do?

00:20:13.970 --> 00:20:15.090
I'll sing.

00:20:16.430 --> 00:20:18.400
I'll sing!

00:20:18.400 --> 00:20:19.670
But...

00:20:19.670 --> 00:20:24.500
I think I can do it... 
Because Senpai is here listening to me.

00:20:25.120 --> 00:20:27.630
Yay, yay!

00:20:27.630 --> 00:20:29.340
Cool!

00:20:29.340 --> 00:20:30.450
It's from Yua.

00:20:31.680 --> 00:20:36.750
There's been a mix-up, 
so I actually get to sing!

00:20:36.750 --> 00:20:40.230
Don't miss my performance! Wassup!

00:20:40.230 --> 00:20:43.090
They're letting Yua sing!

00:20:43.090 --> 00:20:45.760
What, what? Let me see!

00:20:47.870 --> 00:20:50.360
I'm so happy for you.

00:20:52.170 --> 00:20:54.020
Yua-chan!

00:20:54.710 --> 00:20:56.370
You can do it!

00:20:58.900 --> 00:21:00.110
Yeah!

00:21:00.700 --> 00:21:05.870
And now who you've all been waiting for. 
Please welcome Sakurai Yua-chan!

00:21:07.230 --> 00:21:10.890
Ready and... Yua-chan!

00:21:10.890 --> 00:21:15.270
And without further ado, give it up 
for Yua singing "Secret Princess!"

00:21:16.630 --> 00:21:18.460
Here she goes!

00:21:19.410 --> 00:21:21.840
Good luck, Yua-chan.

00:21:25.590 --> 00:21:28.500
It'll be okay. I can do it.

00:21:28.500 --> 00:21:34.510
I'm Sakurai Yua from the Violet Class. 
Please enjoy my song.

00:21:34.510 --> 00:21:38.190
No! It's not like back then! Help me, Senpai!

00:21:39.090 --> 00:21:41.520
Senpai, where are you?

00:21:41.520 --> 00:21:43.020
Senpai...

00:21:43.020 --> 00:21:44.390
Where are you?

00:21:45.170 --> 00:21:46.790
What's the matter?

00:21:46.790 --> 00:21:49.370
Hasn't the song already started?

00:21:49.370 --> 00:21:50.450
Yua...

00:21:58.980 --> 00:22:01.340
It's no use, I can't sing!

00:22:08.820 --> 00:22:09.940
Yua...

00:22:31.840 --> 00:22:36.410
Maybe I was wrong to pretend not to notice your worries.

00:22:36.410 --> 00:22:41.220
It's okay if you can't tell me everything.

00:22:41.220 --> 00:22:43.600
With that dark look on your face,

00:22:43.600 --> 00:22:45.840
go ahead and scream dark things.

00:22:45.840 --> 00:22:50.150
You shouldn't leave all those heavy feelings inside.

00:22:50.150 --> 00:22:51.630
Ride On!

00:22:55.020 --> 00:22:57.830
If you don't... If it's like that...

00:22:57.830 --> 00:23:00.750
You couldn't tell me if you wanted to, huh?

00:23:02.010 --> 00:23:04.500
I get it.

00:23:04.500 --> 00:23:07.160
I'm sure your circumstances will change one day.

00:23:07.160 --> 00:23:10.190
That time will come! That time is now!

00:23:14.010 --> 00:23:15.820
Don't you want to have someone

00:23:15.820 --> 00:23:18.450
say congratulations to you once in your life?

00:23:18.450 --> 00:23:23.380
Doesn't the breeze feel nice today?

00:23:23.380 --> 00:23:27.750
Even if you feel like it's all you can do to survive...

00:23:27.750 --> 00:23:32.620
You can make your life into something you enjoy. It's so nice!

00:23:32.620 --> 00:23:37.440
"Everything's for you."

00:23:37.440 --> 00:23:42.040
How about that?

00:23:43.740 --> 00:23:45.190
My boy!

00:23:50.320 --> 00:23:52.500
What's wrong with Yua-chan?

00:23:52.500 --> 00:23:54.310
Did something bad happen?

00:23:54.310 --> 00:23:56.600
And now, I'll sing "Worry."

00:23:56.600 --> 00:23:59.600
Perhaps she forgot the lyrics.

00:23:59.600 --> 00:24:02.240
And now, I'll sing "That's Not Right!"

00:24:02.240 --> 00:24:05.310
I'm sure Yua has a 
good reason for this.

00:24:05.310 --> 00:24:06.670
Can you tell me, Cecil?

00:24:06.670 --> 00:24:10.200
And now, I'll sing "What Happened That Day."

00:24:10.200 --> 00:24:12.410
Next time on Shugo Chara!! Doki:

00:24:12.410 --> 00:24:15.000
Resound, My Voice! To Who I Used to Be!!

00:24:15.000 --> 00:24:16.560
You can do it, Yua-chan!

00:24:16.560 --> 00:24:19.180
Please let me hear you sing, Yua!
